# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-9be8a27bfe2c8c2a64298d0a7fbeab744e809545 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline as a time limit [[cite:obs-c96d7b295af5c79452bc91acec01df20cf0ecd67 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].
